@url = http://localhost:3000/api

### Registro
POST {{url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Martín", "email": "martin@mail.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login (copiá el token en @token de los otros archivos)
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "martin@mail.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login con datos inválidos (400)
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "no-es-email", "password": "" }
